WEBVTT

01:37.470 --> 01:42.990
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.340 --> 01:46.020
[Episode 22]

02:00.310 --> 02:01.560
What a good show.

02:03.280 --> 02:05.430
I've enjoyed the show so much

02:05.680 --> 02:07.610
that half my anger is gone already.

02:07.920 --> 02:09.870
I never knew there could be so many

02:10.150 --> 02:12.950
interesting things going on
in the Xie household.

02:13.030 --> 02:14.240
Please, go on.

02:15.150 --> 02:16.840
If you keep me entertained,

02:17.520 --> 02:19.280
I might just let

02:19.870 --> 02:21.670
what happened last night slide.

02:22.400 --> 02:23.560
Since Qinghe

02:24.280 --> 02:26.030
has abandoned the Xie family,

02:27.150 --> 02:28.610
as far as we're concerned,

02:28.910 --> 02:31.960
the Xie family
has never had such a daughter.

02:41.310 --> 02:43.030
Three feet of silk,

02:43.750 --> 02:45.120
a stage for a play.

02:46.079 --> 02:47.800
At first, you don't know

02:48.150 --> 02:49.680
what the play means.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.970
Look again, and you're already

02:52.120 --> 02:53.750
part of it.

02:54.750 --> 02:59.030
Commander, you want to hear about
the Xie family's interesting stories.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.190
But I'd say

03:02.120 --> 03:03.680
the most interesting one

03:04.360 --> 03:05.840
is that if you

03:06.150 --> 03:08.280
had married Qingyuan back then,

03:08.590 --> 03:10.320
there wouldn't be a rumor today

03:10.630 --> 03:13.240
about her meeting a man in secret.

03:13.800 --> 03:17.120
Commander, why

03:17.870 --> 03:18.750
won't you

03:19.360 --> 03:21.030
just let the Xie family go?

03:22.000 --> 03:23.000
Could it be

03:23.840 --> 03:26.150
that you still have designs on Qingyuan?

03:26.840 --> 03:28.590
You might as well tell us today,

03:28.840 --> 03:31.280
so we can prepare ourselves

03:31.910 --> 03:32.910
and think about

03:33.590 --> 03:35.280
how to weather

03:35.840 --> 03:37.840
the Marquis of Danyang household's

03:38.360 --> 03:40.360
thunderous fury.

03:44.150 --> 03:45.030
Grandmother,

03:46.079 --> 03:47.710
I was the one who gave Eldest Sister

03:47.710 --> 03:49.150
the idea to elope.

03:50.030 --> 03:52.120
I was the one who disguised myself as her,

03:52.120 --> 03:53.150
lured those people away,

03:53.150 --> 03:54.880
and gave her a chance to escape.

03:55.190 --> 03:56.050
And I was the one

03:56.520 --> 03:57.520
who accidentally

03:57.710 --> 03:59.040
ran into the Commander.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.800
There's nothing

04:03.310 --> 04:04.970
between the Commander and me.

04:05.360 --> 04:07.840
But I take full responsibility

04:08.150 --> 04:09.710
for such an improper act

04:09.960 --> 04:11.750
that brought Commander here
to question us.

04:11.750 --> 04:13.360
I apologize to Grandmother

04:13.360 --> 04:14.030
and Father,

04:14.590 --> 04:16.160
and to Commander as well.

04:21.430 --> 04:25.040
Why didn't I think
there was nothing between us?

04:27.720 --> 04:31.560
Fourth Lady, how exactly did you
distinguish yourself from me?

04:34.720 --> 04:37.270
Lord Xie, you certainly raised
your children well.

04:37.270 --> 04:42.070
The Xie family truly lives up to the saying,
"the apple doesn't fall far from the tree."

04:43.510 --> 04:44.310
I thought

04:44.310 --> 04:47.070
a woman as extraordinary as Fourth Lady

04:47.070 --> 04:48.600
would be different.

04:48.750 --> 04:50.190
But to my surprise, even as

04:50.190 --> 04:53.520
the fiancée of the honorable Heir
to the Marquis of Danyang,

04:53.750 --> 04:55.159
she could still

04:55.159 --> 04:58.510
sneak around with another man
in the middle of the night.

04:58.900 --> 05:01.430
Your Ladyship, your present is an honor.

05:01.600 --> 05:04.000
Forgive us for not welcoming you properly.

05:07.240 --> 05:09.170
Why are you kneeling on the ground?

05:09.480 --> 05:12.000
It pains me to see you like this.

05:19.120 --> 05:19.980
Your Ladyship,

05:21.600 --> 05:22.950
what brings you here?

05:26.560 --> 05:28.430
Xie Qinghe lured my nephew away.

05:29.120 --> 05:31.380
Naturally, I'm here to demand an answer.

05:32.110 --> 05:34.370
Another person here to demand an answer.

05:35.120 --> 05:37.050
Commander, since you are here too,

05:37.240 --> 05:38.120
I'll have you

05:38.430 --> 05:40.190
bear witness.

05:41.070 --> 05:42.270
Now that the marriage

05:42.560 --> 05:45.560
between our Pei family
and the Eldest Lady Xie has been called off,

05:45.560 --> 05:47.960
we have no further ties
with the Xie family.

05:48.040 --> 05:50.370
Your Eldest Lady left without permission

05:50.510 --> 05:52.000
and eloped with my nephew,

05:52.240 --> 05:54.430
tarnishing the Pei family's reputation

05:54.430 --> 05:56.040
and making us
the laughingstock of Hengtang.

05:56.040 --> 05:57.040
How do you

05:58.240 --> 05:59.700
plan to settle this score?

06:01.510 --> 06:03.840
Your Ladyship, that is rather one-sided.

06:04.480 --> 06:07.210
My eldest sister and Young Master Pei
are in love.

06:07.240 --> 06:09.560
Leaving together
was a decision of both of them.

06:09.560 --> 06:11.720
How can you say that either one
lured the other?

06:11.720 --> 06:14.040
Your Ladyship, you are absolutely right.

06:14.040 --> 06:16.630
This is entirely the Xie family's fault.

06:17.120 --> 06:19.720
My unfilial daughter
behaved disgracefully.

06:20.310 --> 06:21.600
I hereby

06:21.660 --> 06:25.720
apologize to the Founding Count's family.

06:27.070 --> 06:30.470
I hope this will not affect
the bond between our two families.

06:34.270 --> 06:35.510
The bond?

06:35.870 --> 06:37.730
Who says we have any bond with you?

06:43.310 --> 06:44.800
Our Pei ancestors

06:45.310 --> 06:47.710
helped the Grand Emperor conquer the realm

06:48.070 --> 06:50.270
and were granted
the title of Founding Count.

06:50.270 --> 06:53.800
Your Xie family only earned your title
because of a son who died.

06:54.560 --> 06:57.220
How can your family
possibly compare with ours?

06:57.870 --> 06:58.480
You...

07:06.830 --> 07:08.720
Well, in your opinion,

07:09.200 --> 07:12.010
what can we do

07:12.510 --> 07:15.920
to let you vent your anger?

07:19.350 --> 07:22.010
If you want to make amends,
it's not impossible.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.750
You took my nephew away,

07:24.250 --> 07:26.120
so you owe me a person in return.

07:28.680 --> 07:29.800
Your Xie family seems

07:29.800 --> 07:32.190
to have plenty of plain-looking girls.

07:32.680 --> 07:34.159
This Fourth Lady is the only one

07:34.159 --> 07:35.560
who's pleasing to my eye.

07:36.000 --> 07:36.720
Why not

07:37.010 --> 07:39.070
give her to me as a maid?

07:40.680 --> 07:43.630
Then I'll let bygones be bygones.

07:46.040 --> 07:48.920
Your Ladyship, you're going too far.

07:49.560 --> 07:52.070
Whatever wrongs Xie Qingyuan
may have done,

07:52.560 --> 07:55.240
she is still a lady of the Xie family.

07:55.830 --> 07:57.000
Humiliating her

07:57.630 --> 07:59.360
is humiliating the Xie family,

08:00.430 --> 08:03.800
which is humiliating the Earl of Zhongyong,
whose title

08:04.360 --> 08:06.620
was personally bestowed by His Majesty!

08:10.120 --> 08:10.920
What?

08:12.160 --> 08:14.950
You gave your daughter
to the Hu family as a concubine,

08:14.950 --> 08:17.010
and that was perfectly respectable?

08:17.130 --> 08:19.310
I simply took a liking
to Fourth Lady's beauty

08:19.310 --> 08:21.110
and wanted to take her as my maid.

08:21.120 --> 08:22.830
They're both selling daughters.

08:22.830 --> 08:24.690
How exactly am I humiliating you?

08:25.240 --> 08:26.120
Absurd.

08:26.830 --> 08:31.480
Xie Qingyuan is betrothed to
the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

08:32.000 --> 08:33.390
You want her?

08:33.909 --> 08:37.030
Have you asked the Heir?

08:40.630 --> 08:42.320
Old Madam,

08:42.669 --> 08:43.669
at your age,

08:43.669 --> 08:45.930
why are you using a junior to pressure me?

08:46.440 --> 08:50.120
You should ask Fourth Lady this—

08:51.000 --> 08:53.080
she already has a betrothal to
the Marquis of Danyang's Heir,

08:53.080 --> 08:55.200
yet she was caught
meeting the Commander in secret.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.930
What would the Marquis's household
make of that?

08:58.000 --> 08:59.750
The wedding hasn't even taken place,

08:59.750 --> 09:01.550
and the Xie family
has caused such a scandal.

09:01.550 --> 09:02.960
I've never

09:02.960 --> 09:04.420
heard of anything like it.

09:07.600 --> 09:08.360
You...

09:09.120 --> 09:09.630
You...

09:09.720 --> 09:12.600
I've long heard about
Her Ladyship's sense of humor.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.270
Mother,

09:13.790 --> 09:16.120
it's indeed a well-deserved reputation.

09:16.550 --> 09:18.270
She really knows how to joke.

09:23.270 --> 09:25.870
Didn't the Fourth Lady just say

09:26.630 --> 09:28.500
that there's nothing between us?

09:29.150 --> 09:29.960
In fact,

09:30.270 --> 09:32.840
I'm the one with ulterior motives.

09:33.630 --> 09:36.090
I'm the one who has feelings
for Fourth Lady.

09:36.510 --> 09:37.870
So what exactly

09:37.960 --> 09:39.360
did Fourth Lady do wrong?

09:46.270 --> 09:46.790
Good.

09:47.270 --> 09:48.000
Well said.

09:48.490 --> 09:50.270
What a perfect couple.

09:50.550 --> 09:53.150
It makes me quite jealous.

09:54.910 --> 09:57.640
However, since my nephew Lanshan
was lured away,

09:58.000 --> 09:59.930
I can hardly congratulate you two.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.180
Your Ladyship.

10:03.790 --> 10:06.240
My unfilial eldest daughter

10:07.000 --> 10:10.200
will be brought back to you

10:12.480 --> 10:13.610
as soon as possible.

10:13.720 --> 10:14.960
You may do with her

10:14.960 --> 10:15.910
as you please.

10:17.630 --> 10:20.430
I'll definitely
give the Founding Count's family

10:20.630 --> 10:22.240
a satisfactory answer.

10:29.120 --> 10:30.050
Lord Xie, I think

10:30.750 --> 10:33.350
the Xie family's hundred acres
of fertile land

10:33.390 --> 10:34.480
would be

10:34.750 --> 10:37.630
a fitting answer
to the Founding Count's family.

10:39.390 --> 10:40.520
Don't take offense.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.320
As his aunt,

10:42.840 --> 10:45.320
I have to look out for my nephew.

10:53.910 --> 10:56.640
A pity your concern is misplaced,
Your Ladyship.

10:56.670 --> 10:58.250
It goes against

10:58.440 --> 10:59.970
Young Master Pei's wishes.

11:00.440 --> 11:03.360
How can you claim to be acting
for his own good?

11:04.720 --> 11:06.120
My eldest sister ran away

11:06.510 --> 11:08.510
from her betrothal to the Hu family.

11:08.600 --> 11:11.060
What does that have to do
with the Pei family?

11:15.120 --> 11:16.480
I had no idea

11:16.720 --> 11:19.150
that Your Ladyship's reach was this long.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.720
So you think

11:24.600 --> 11:26.330
you can speak for the Hu family?

11:29.270 --> 11:31.550
Fourth Lady,
you certainly have a silver tongue,

11:31.550 --> 11:33.680
which makes me more interested in you.

11:34.080 --> 11:36.810
But I wonder,
now that the Xie family has offended

11:36.960 --> 11:40.960
both the Marquis of Danyang's household
and the Pei family over the elopement,

11:40.960 --> 11:44.000
how will you hold your ground in Hengtang
from now on?

11:44.870 --> 11:48.800
Who says the Xie family has offended
the Marquis of Danyang household?

11:55.270 --> 11:56.200
Father-in-law.

11:56.480 --> 11:57.280
Grandmother.

12:00.510 --> 12:01.370
Your Ladyship.

12:05.030 --> 12:05.790
Qingyuan.

12:13.120 --> 12:13.870
Heir.

12:16.790 --> 12:18.590
Heir, you sure are magnanimous,

12:19.390 --> 12:21.650
willing to tolerate what others cannot.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.570
I trust Qingyuan's character.

12:25.750 --> 12:27.000
Now that she is betrothed,

12:27.000 --> 12:28.080
she would never do anything

12:28.080 --> 12:30.240
to let
the Marquis of Danyang household down.

12:30.240 --> 12:31.300
So, Your Ladyship,

12:31.390 --> 12:34.050
please don't trouble yourself
over our family.

12:40.750 --> 12:41.960
As for the elopement,

12:42.960 --> 12:46.360
the Xie family will certainly apologize
to Commissioner Hu.

12:47.080 --> 12:48.030
Your Ladyship,

12:48.440 --> 12:49.840
If there is nothing else,

12:50.750 --> 12:52.120
please leave.

12:54.910 --> 12:55.840
Fine.

12:56.870 --> 12:58.080
You're all here putting on an act
for me now.

12:58.080 --> 12:59.440
here.

13:00.200 --> 13:02.550
I wonder if you can still be as close
as a family

13:02.550 --> 13:04.270
after I leave.

13:17.320 --> 13:18.600
We will meet again.

13:26.510 --> 13:27.840
One day,

13:28.000 --> 13:32.330
One day, I'll have the Xie family and
the Palace Guard Division under my thumb.

13:35.750 --> 13:36.550
Qingyuan.

13:40.670 --> 13:42.000
I came immediately when I heard

13:42.000 --> 13:43.670
something happened to the Xie family.

13:43.670 --> 13:44.670
Seeing that you're alright

13:44.670 --> 13:45.800
puts my mind at ease.

13:47.360 --> 13:49.220
Thank you for your concern, Heir.

13:52.240 --> 13:53.150
You said just

13:53.720 --> 13:55.920
that Eldest Lady Xie eloped because she

13:55.960 --> 13:57.960
didn't want to be forced into a marriage.

13:57.960 --> 13:59.270
So, Fourth Lady,

13:59.270 --> 14:01.360
were you also forced by the Xie family

14:01.380 --> 14:03.930
to marry
the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang?

14:13.550 --> 14:14.320
No.

14:18.790 --> 14:20.200
It is what I want.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.200
Commander.

14:27.630 --> 14:28.910
It's getting late.

14:29.270 --> 14:31.390
Now that this matter is settled,

14:31.600 --> 14:33.960
and you've said that what happened
last night

14:33.960 --> 14:35.890
had nothing to do with Qingyuan,

14:36.150 --> 14:37.480
let's leave it at that.

14:40.270 --> 14:42.320
Old Madam, there's no need to rush me out.

14:42.320 --> 14:44.510
Are you planning
to keep punishing Fourth Lady

14:44.510 --> 14:46.630
after I leave to vent your anger?

14:46.790 --> 14:47.850
I can't allow that.

14:50.270 --> 14:53.320
Our Xie family is fair when it comes to
rewards and punishments,

14:53.320 --> 14:55.450
but Qingyuan is my daughter after all.

14:55.750 --> 14:57.720
How could I mistreat her?

14:58.600 --> 15:00.390
You can rest assured.

15:01.030 --> 15:03.550
I already made my feelings for her clear.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.570
I've made up my mind.

15:05.870 --> 15:08.470
Starting today,
I'll stay at the Xie Residence

15:13.510 --> 15:15.200
to keep her safe.

15:22.870 --> 15:23.720
Third Madam.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.500
Sister Fangchun said

15:25.950 --> 15:27.510
that Eldest Sister and Young Master Pei

15:27.510 --> 15:29.310
have already crossed the river.

15:29.510 --> 15:30.770
Neither the Xie family

15:30.870 --> 15:31.940
nor the Pei family

15:32.240 --> 15:33.700
can catch up with them now.

15:34.480 --> 15:35.390
That's good.

15:37.000 --> 15:38.000
Third Madam,

15:38.840 --> 15:40.770
what are your plans for the future?

15:41.670 --> 15:43.400
I'm going to stay in the temple.

15:43.670 --> 15:45.070
I should have broken free

15:45.910 --> 15:47.770
from this household cage long ago

15:48.320 --> 15:49.520
and lived for myself.

15:51.150 --> 15:53.000
Now I've finally gotten my wish.

15:55.480 --> 15:57.740
You don't need to worry about me anymore.

16:04.870 --> 16:06.030
This thing

16:06.840 --> 16:08.510
was left by your Mother.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.700
I should have returned it to you long ago.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.080
I...

16:15.390 --> 16:16.270
am sorry.

16:22.840 --> 16:23.840
I think

16:25.000 --> 16:27.790
if your Mother
could see you like this today,

16:28.150 --> 16:29.120
smart,

16:29.480 --> 16:30.240
brave,

16:30.600 --> 16:31.870
and beautiful,

16:32.670 --> 16:34.630
she would definitely be very happy

16:34.790 --> 16:35.910
and proud.

16:40.840 --> 16:42.510
Though I don't want you

16:43.030 --> 16:44.480
to be consumed by hatred,

16:45.790 --> 16:47.650
if this is the path you've chosen,

16:48.390 --> 16:50.150
I'll pray for you

16:50.600 --> 16:52.440
every day.

16:54.270 --> 16:57.840
May the blessings I've earned

16:58.080 --> 16:59.540
see you safely on your way.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.600
Thank you, Third Madam.

17:07.750 --> 17:08.480
Third Madam.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.280
Take care.

17:55.160 --> 17:56.440
That is because

17:57.240 --> 18:00.550
Xie Shu is hiding a secret
he can tell no one.

18:02.960 --> 18:04.480
A monstrous secret.

18:14.550 --> 18:15.510
And that secret

18:16.920 --> 18:18.980
lies in your mother's bronze mirror.

18:44.390 --> 18:46.430
[Fuyu Pavilion]

18:51.530 --> 18:52.140
[Qinyue Corridor]

18:54.850 --> 18:59.890
[Fuyu Pavilion]

18:58.440 --> 19:00.160
Would you really be content
marrying someone

19:00.160 --> 19:01.020
you don't love?

19:13.240 --> 19:15.350
I'd regret it even more

19:16.310 --> 19:18.040
if I couldn't avenge my mother.

19:21.590 --> 19:22.790
My Lord,

19:23.310 --> 19:26.030
I've been betrothed to the Heir
of the Marquis of Danyang.

19:26.030 --> 19:28.090
We shouldn't meet like this anymore.

19:29.960 --> 19:30.510
Shen Run, you...

19:30.510 --> 19:31.570
Who dares to stop me

19:31.750 --> 19:32.950
when I want to see you?

19:33.830 --> 19:34.490
Put me down!

19:42.880 --> 19:44.960
I want things between us to be improper.

19:44.960 --> 19:45.960
Who can save you?

19:48.030 --> 19:48.920
Tell me,

19:50.070 --> 19:52.130
was everything between us in the past

19:52.310 --> 19:53.310
a lie?

20:02.830 --> 20:03.920
So

20:04.720 --> 20:06.400
you never liked me?

20:08.240 --> 20:09.960
Why are you afraid to look at me?

20:09.960 --> 20:10.720
Look at me.

20:11.480 --> 20:12.610
Answer my question.

20:16.560 --> 20:18.140
Must I like you?

20:21.420 --> 20:22.640
Say it again.

20:26.920 --> 20:28.720
Say again that you don't like me.

20:30.110 --> 20:31.910
Say again that you don't like me!

20:38.920 --> 20:39.850
You won't say it?

20:41.590 --> 20:42.920
Then you must like me.

20:45.680 --> 20:47.880
Even if we're destined
to take different paths,

20:47.880 --> 20:49.740
if you're going to marry someone,

20:49.920 --> 20:51.250
marry someone you love.

20:53.680 --> 20:54.940
That's not necessary.

20:59.550 --> 21:01.010
I want to take down Xie Shu,

21:02.070 --> 21:03.600
and you want to protect him.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.760
Since we are on different paths,

21:06.030 --> 21:08.630
there is no need for us
to be entangled anymore.

21:14.460 --> 21:16.330
[Fuyu Pavilion]

21:28.640 --> 21:31.300
Commander,
I have long heard you are heartless.

21:31.640 --> 21:33.770
I didn't expect you to have such a side.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.500
What do you want to say?

21:36.880 --> 21:39.270
I just wanted to remind you again

21:39.880 --> 21:43.480
not to forget His Majesty's instructions
before our departure.

21:45.030 --> 21:47.790
Not only have I not forgotten
His Majesty's instructions,

21:47.790 --> 21:50.000
but I also know why he gave them.

21:52.720 --> 21:54.780
Since you know how important this is,

21:55.070 --> 21:56.930
you should be even more cautious.

22:04.880 --> 22:05.680
Mother,

22:07.200 --> 22:09.160
failing to secure the marriage
with the Hu family

22:09.160 --> 22:11.550
is ultimately disadvantageous for us.

22:17.080 --> 22:24.100
[Harmony Among Kin]

22:17.270 --> 22:20.240
At least we didn't lose

22:20.590 --> 22:22.050
the Marquis's household.

22:22.310 --> 22:24.440
Even if it's the lesser of two options,

22:25.310 --> 22:27.640
it's still better than losing everything.

22:27.640 --> 22:29.790
Qingyuan's wedding is coming up.

22:30.680 --> 22:33.720
Although she helped Qinghe escape,

22:35.240 --> 22:36.880
as her father,

22:38.160 --> 22:40.510
you should know
to focus on the bigger picture

22:40.510 --> 22:42.170
and let the smaller things go.

22:43.110 --> 22:45.830
Take good care of this future...

22:47.070 --> 22:48.680
marchioness.

22:49.310 --> 22:50.350
I understand.

22:52.830 --> 22:54.030
You must remember

22:55.640 --> 22:58.270
that the family estate you manage today

22:59.480 --> 23:03.030
is not solely your own achievement.

23:03.720 --> 23:05.880
It is the foundation our ancestors

23:06.480 --> 23:08.110
built for you.

23:09.000 --> 23:09.960
In the future,

23:10.960 --> 23:12.720
you will need your descendants

23:13.200 --> 23:16.070
to build upon it
and make it even stronger.

23:16.590 --> 23:19.350
Never become so full of yourself

23:19.920 --> 23:23.240
that you forget how you

23:24.160 --> 23:25.880
made it through this day.

23:40.110 --> 23:41.030
Yes.

23:41.880 --> 23:43.810
Mother, you are absolutely right.

23:44.000 --> 23:45.720
We must never forget our roots.

23:45.720 --> 23:47.750
I will never forget

23:47.960 --> 23:51.310
how you raised me
and cared for me from childhood.

23:52.030 --> 23:53.240
Even now,

23:54.720 --> 23:55.920
in the Xie family,

23:56.350 --> 23:57.960
you are still the pillar.

24:02.110 --> 24:03.350
That is why

24:03.680 --> 24:05.750
I often feel ashamed.

24:07.270 --> 24:10.830
Ever since you entrusted
the family seal to me back then,

24:11.310 --> 24:12.750
you've still

24:12.920 --> 24:14.790
been carrying much of the burden

24:14.790 --> 24:17.960
of this family on your shoulders.

24:18.640 --> 24:20.440
I've truly fallen short.

24:22.590 --> 24:23.720
I will definitely

24:24.830 --> 24:26.750
work twice as hard

24:27.110 --> 24:29.110
and strive to shoulder

24:29.110 --> 24:31.400
the Xie family entirely myself
as soon as I can,

24:31.400 --> 24:33.370
so you can enjoy a peaceful life

24:34.070 --> 24:36.730
and spend your twilight years
in comfort early.

24:55.900 --> 24:58.350
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

25:06.550 --> 25:08.210
Have things been taken care of

25:09.240 --> 25:10.720
with Hu Wenzhuo?

25:12.030 --> 25:14.550
If she really brings Commissioner Hu here,

25:15.310 --> 25:16.850
putting aside whether

25:17.240 --> 25:19.110
he'll cause trouble for you,

25:19.750 --> 25:21.590
Shen Run alone

25:23.160 --> 25:24.560
will be hard to deal with.

25:26.920 --> 25:28.120
Don't worry, Mother.

25:28.960 --> 25:31.310
I have written a letter overnight,

25:31.720 --> 25:34.960
detailing the situation in Hengtang.

25:35.440 --> 25:36.240
Rest assured.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.240
Master!

25:39.480 --> 25:40.110
Old Madam!

25:39.590 --> 25:41.110
[Harmony Among Kin]

25:41.150 --> 25:43.240
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

25:41.440 --> 25:42.370
Commissioner Hu

25:42.400 --> 25:43.240
is arriving.

26:20.510 --> 26:21.310
Dear,

26:23.070 --> 26:24.510
have some pastries.

26:25.270 --> 26:26.730
I made them for you myself.

26:35.440 --> 26:37.960
What kind of pastries
could possibly be worth

26:37.960 --> 26:40.830
the trouble of bringing them
to me yourself?

26:43.070 --> 26:44.130
Let me take a guess.

26:45.680 --> 26:47.070
My brother

26:47.880 --> 26:49.400
is coming.

26:52.790 --> 26:55.200
Lord Hu Xing is here,

26:56.960 --> 26:59.270
and Xie Shu is scared.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.750
Dear,

27:16.830 --> 27:18.440
that's not fair.

27:19.240 --> 27:20.590
Do you have any idea

27:22.030 --> 27:23.030
how much trouble

27:24.640 --> 27:27.880
I've gone through for your sake?

27:28.880 --> 27:29.940
Do you know how much

27:30.750 --> 27:33.350
it pains me to see you like this?

27:46.400 --> 27:47.270
Go.

27:48.000 --> 27:49.720
Bring me the new clothes

27:50.920 --> 27:52.510
I just had made.

27:58.790 --> 27:59.480
Mother,

27:59.830 --> 28:00.690
are you sleepy?

28:00.920 --> 28:01.960
I'm not sleepy.

28:03.550 --> 28:04.830
I'm so sleepy.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.240
Mother,

28:13.570 --> 28:14.790
when do you think

28:14.920 --> 28:16.270
Uncle will arrive?

28:20.030 --> 28:20.920
Mother!

28:27.880 --> 28:28.880
I fell asleep.

28:29.400 --> 28:31.730
I'm getting old. I'm not much use anymore.

28:32.400 --> 28:33.830
I'll go back and rest.

28:35.070 --> 28:36.800
When Commissioner Hu arrives,

28:37.200 --> 28:38.590
apologize to him for me.

28:47.480 --> 28:48.160
Father, Mother,

28:48.160 --> 28:50.360
I'll take Grandmother back to rest now.

28:56.160 --> 28:57.820
You should also get some rest.

29:18.030 --> 29:19.830
My brother's visiting this time

29:20.920 --> 29:23.240
has brought back so many memories.

29:27.480 --> 29:30.160
Where was it that we first met?

29:30.830 --> 29:32.560
At the Chrysanthemum Festival

29:33.070 --> 29:34.270
in Hengtang.

29:40.110 --> 29:41.270
That day,

29:42.920 --> 29:44.400
you were dressed in green.

29:45.830 --> 29:47.200
You hardly spoke,

29:47.750 --> 29:50.400
but your pride couldn't be hidden.

29:50.960 --> 29:53.160
Many people thought you were dull

29:53.750 --> 29:54.640
and aloof,

29:56.200 --> 29:57.440
but I thought

30:00.550 --> 30:03.750
you were completely different
from those young noblemen

30:04.680 --> 30:06.210
who fawned over my brother.

30:19.510 --> 30:21.160
I was foolish enough

30:22.310 --> 30:25.720
to believe in that noble, unyielding facade
of yours.

30:27.050 --> 30:29.090
I've never lied to you.

30:39.350 --> 30:41.610
Enough about these meaningless things.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.750
Between you and me

30:43.070 --> 30:44.930
lie the lives of our two children.

30:45.400 --> 30:48.200
No affection can make up
for this blood debt.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.160
Besides,

30:54.680 --> 30:55.940
have you ever loved me?

30:58.750 --> 31:00.720
What are you trying to say?

31:15.270 --> 31:18.470
The humiliation
I suffered in the Xie family for decades—

31:19.640 --> 31:20.510
I'll let it go.

31:21.550 --> 31:23.160
But my last concern

31:23.880 --> 31:26.640
is the marriages of Qingrong and Qingru.

31:27.110 --> 31:28.880
If they make good marriages,

31:29.640 --> 31:31.200
I'll let everything go.

31:31.550 --> 31:34.070
But if you can't even do that,

31:58.680 --> 32:00.160
I'll have my brother

32:01.480 --> 32:03.070
wipe out the Xie family,

32:06.270 --> 32:07.770
leaving no one spared.

32:47.070 --> 32:48.640
Looks like

32:49.480 --> 32:52.270
your brother-in-law isn't coming.

32:52.920 --> 32:54.350
What a pity.

32:54.790 --> 32:55.550
Yes.

32:56.890 --> 32:57.880
What a pity.

32:58.830 --> 33:00.110
I thought

33:00.240 --> 33:02.500
I'd finally get to meet Commissioner Hu.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.960
On my way here,

33:08.240 --> 33:09.750
I suddenly remembered

33:10.550 --> 33:13.720
that when I was little,
I once called you "Uncle"

33:14.310 --> 33:17.970
and witnessed the friendship
between you and my father back then.

33:18.030 --> 33:22.690
I also know that you once traveled
to the capital together to take the imperial exam,

33:22.790 --> 33:24.880
sharing the same lofty ambitions.

33:26.790 --> 33:28.350
How could you

33:28.720 --> 33:30.440
forget the old days?

33:30.830 --> 33:32.110
Back then,

33:32.880 --> 33:34.400
your father and I

33:35.310 --> 33:38.070
made a solemn vow together.

33:38.640 --> 33:39.830
I, Shen Zhibai.

33:40.200 --> 33:41.070
And I, Xie Shu.

33:41.480 --> 33:43.640
We hereby swear to become sworn brothers.

33:43.640 --> 33:45.590
We weren't born on the same day,

33:45.680 --> 33:48.550
but we ask to die on the same day.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.350
Before Lord Guan,

33:50.350 --> 33:52.600
we make this oath.

33:52.620 --> 33:53.510
Should either of us break it,

33:53.510 --> 33:55.110
may Heaven strike us down!

34:01.310 --> 34:02.240
Brother.

34:02.240 --> 34:03.240
Brother.

34:05.000 --> 34:07.800
Even if I have to die
a thousand deaths in this life,

34:08.510 --> 34:10.480
I will never forget it.

34:11.710 --> 34:13.190
For the past 9 years,

34:14.800 --> 34:16.400
I've never understood

34:17.360 --> 34:20.030
what interest could have driven
everyone here

34:21.760 --> 34:23.760
to jointly frame

34:24.320 --> 34:26.070
a good official,

34:26.440 --> 34:27.400
accusing him

34:27.550 --> 34:29.150
of pocketing the coal supplies

34:29.150 --> 34:30.880
and delaying disaster relief,

34:31.440 --> 34:34.100
which led to dozens of people
freezing to death.

34:34.920 --> 34:36.480
What was really going on?

34:38.480 --> 34:40.920
And where did the money go that they

34:41.150 --> 34:43.010
accused my father of embezzling?

34:46.760 --> 34:48.670
It wasn't until I came to Hengtang

34:50.190 --> 34:52.880
that I started hearing
so much about that lord.

34:53.550 --> 34:56.590
Lord Xie, you refused
to tell me who he was.

34:57.030 --> 34:59.160
And those criminals who were tortured

34:59.480 --> 35:01.440
and sentenced to death

35:02.070 --> 35:04.320
also refused to tell me who he was.

35:05.360 --> 35:08.920
It wasn't until you hastily arranged
to marry off your daughters

35:08.920 --> 35:10.800
that I suddenly understood.

35:14.000 --> 35:15.960
The man you've been desperately trying to win over,

35:15.960 --> 35:18.030
the man you've been currying favor with,

35:18.030 --> 35:19.880
was that lord behind it all—

35:21.190 --> 35:22.760
your brother-in-law,

35:24.280 --> 35:27.140
Hu Xing, who now holds the position of Commissioner

35:28.150 --> 35:29.150
at court.

35:32.510 --> 35:33.590
The coal case

35:35.000 --> 35:36.110
back then

35:37.760 --> 35:39.960
had nothing to do with me.

35:40.510 --> 35:43.640
I know nothing

35:44.110 --> 35:46.170
about the lord you're talking about.

35:46.550 --> 35:47.630
If it really

35:49.110 --> 35:50.840
was Lord Hu,

35:54.030 --> 35:56.230
then at most, it was merely...

35:57.150 --> 35:58.280
a coincidence.

36:00.000 --> 36:03.360
Then is it also a coincidence
that His Majesty ordered me

36:04.440 --> 36:06.110
to protect you at all costs?

36:07.630 --> 36:08.630
I suppose it is.

36:10.710 --> 36:12.110
What else could it be?

36:15.190 --> 36:16.280
Run,

36:17.000 --> 36:18.400
I just have one thing

36:18.710 --> 36:20.170
I don't quite understand.

36:20.710 --> 36:22.110
Regarding this coal case

36:22.800 --> 36:24.480
involving your late father,

36:24.800 --> 36:28.260
His Majesty has already investigated it thoroughly back then

36:28.960 --> 36:31.000
and cleared your family's name.

36:32.150 --> 36:33.800
Why reopen it now?

36:34.840 --> 36:36.190
The officialdom

36:37.710 --> 36:39.590
is like this bowl of tea.

36:40.440 --> 36:42.500
Once the person who poured it leaves,

36:42.710 --> 36:44.480
it quickly goes cold.

36:45.230 --> 36:47.320
But if you insist on jumping in,

36:47.630 --> 36:51.960
it can become as dangerous as the sea.

36:53.150 --> 36:56.760
You should get out while you can.

37:05.760 --> 37:07.360
Lord Xie, you're a smart man.

37:08.360 --> 37:10.360
You must already know who His Majesty

37:10.360 --> 37:12.010
is targeting.

37:12.710 --> 37:14.630
A royal command cannot be disobeyed.

37:14.630 --> 37:17.360
I'm putting aside my family feud to work with you.

37:18.670 --> 37:20.870
I only hope you truly haven't forgotten

37:22.070 --> 37:23.480
the vow you made.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.070
Brother,

37:26.440 --> 37:27.920
as long as the two of us

37:27.920 --> 37:30.050
stand united and work wholeheartedly

37:30.190 --> 37:31.990
for the court and for the people,

37:32.150 --> 37:34.840
we'll make those corrupt officials in Hengtang

37:34.840 --> 37:37.300
spit out every last tael they've embezzled.

37:38.590 --> 37:39.630
I won't forget.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.760
There are two things

37:44.920 --> 37:46.280
I will never forget

37:47.230 --> 37:48.110
in this life.

37:49.190 --> 37:50.070
First,

37:50.760 --> 37:53.320
His Majesty's grace.

37:54.920 --> 37:55.840
Second,

37:58.400 --> 37:59.670
your father,

38:00.440 --> 38:03.950
my good brother who now rests in heaven,

38:04.670 --> 38:05.880
Lord Shen.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.040
Officer,

38:11.550 --> 38:12.810
you just arrived here,

38:12.880 --> 38:15.150
so I'm afraid you don't know how things work around here.

38:15.150 --> 38:16.010
Think about it.

38:16.320 --> 38:17.570
Whose ship

38:17.800 --> 38:19.000
did you detain today?

38:19.400 --> 38:20.070
And whose cargo

38:20.070 --> 38:21.300
did you confiscate?

38:21.710 --> 38:24.110
Since the ancestors' time, the water transport in Hengtang

38:24.110 --> 38:25.670
has been under the Pei family's control.

38:25.670 --> 38:27.670
Not even the Emperor of Heaven himself

38:27.670 --> 38:29.840
could interfere with this waterway.

38:30.070 --> 38:32.400
I don't care whose rules apply here,

38:33.000 --> 38:34.890
nor do I care whose ship it is.

38:35.280 --> 38:36.280
Today,

38:36.480 --> 38:38.280
none of you is leaving the shore.

38:38.360 --> 38:39.110
I said so.

38:39.670 --> 38:40.550
I...

38:41.070 --> 38:42.000
am the rule.

38:43.150 --> 38:45.280
I'm kindly reminding you.

38:45.440 --> 38:47.150
The water transport belongs to the Pei family,

38:47.150 --> 38:49.030
the Founding Count's family.

38:49.190 --> 38:51.320
Behind them is Commissioner Hu from the capital.

38:51.320 --> 38:53.400
You'd better think this through carefully.

38:53.400 --> 38:55.670
If you insist on stepping into

38:56.000 --> 38:57.230
this den of death,

38:58.510 --> 39:00.960
I'm afraid you might not even have a body left intact.

39:00.960 --> 39:03.290
By then, you can blame no one but yourself!

39:39.150 --> 39:39.800
Stop!

39:48.960 --> 39:50.360
So it's you, Commander.

39:55.840 --> 39:57.460
My subordinates are ignorant.

39:57.460 --> 39:59.980
I hope you'll be gracious enough to let it go

40:00.320 --> 40:02.120
and not let them spoil your mood.

40:04.590 --> 40:05.400
Stop yelling!

40:06.440 --> 40:09.500
If the Commander had made a move, you'd be dead already!

40:13.440 --> 40:16.500
Hurry up and thank the Commander
for sparing your life!

40:21.440 --> 40:22.440
Thank you, Commander,

40:22.440 --> 40:23.570
for sparing my life.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.030
Thank you, Commander,

40:25.030 --> 40:26.400
for sparing our lives!

40:35.510 --> 40:36.240
Fan Zhong,

40:36.280 --> 40:37.400
take them away.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.000
Inventory the cargo,

40:39.000 --> 40:40.670
seal the ship, and check the books.

40:40.670 --> 40:41.110
Yes.

40:43.550 --> 40:45.030
For our wedding, my mother

40:45.670 --> 40:46.400
hired craftsmen

40:46.400 --> 40:49.190
to make new furniture for our bridal chamber from golden-thread nanmu.

40:49.190 --> 40:50.360
My father also asked a friend

40:50.360 --> 40:53.490
to bring dozens of bolts of fine Yun brocade from Suzhou.

40:53.960 --> 40:54.560
Oh, right.

40:55.280 --> 40:56.440
My mother keeps urging me

40:56.440 --> 40:57.710
to decide on the design of the wedding clothes,

40:57.710 --> 40:59.960
but I thought it's better to let you decide.

40:59.960 --> 41:02.160
I will follow your arrangements, Heir.

41:04.840 --> 41:05.480
Qingyuan,

41:07.760 --> 41:09.820
I know you don't have feelings for me,

41:10.920 --> 41:11.760
but I believe

41:12.710 --> 41:13.670
that one day,

41:14.000 --> 41:14.920
you will.

41:15.630 --> 41:16.510
I only hope

41:17.150 --> 41:18.710
that you're not forcing yourself

41:18.710 --> 41:19.970
to make this decision.

41:23.680 --> 41:30.530
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

41:27.320 --> 41:28.650
I'm not forcing myself.

41:29.590 --> 41:31.030
Given my background,

41:30.560 --> 41:37.180
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

41:31.630 --> 41:33.030
having you favor me

41:33.190 --> 41:34.360
is my blessing.

41:37.030 --> 41:38.190
I often feel

41:37.280 --> 41:44.920
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

41:38.760 --> 41:40.820
that you're like a piece of cold jade.

41:41.480 --> 41:43.590
No matter how long I hold you against my body to warm you,

41:43.590 --> 41:44.710
all that ever warms up

41:44.710 --> 41:45.880
is my own body heat.

41:45.040 --> 41:52.340
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

41:46.510 --> 41:47.480
So once I let go,

41:49.110 --> 41:52.110
you'll be cold again, as if no one has ever touched you.

41:52.480 --> 41:59.410
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

41:56.230 --> 41:57.360
But that's alright.

41:57.630 --> 41:58.360
I the future,

41:58.760 --> 41:59.760
I'll always protect you

41:59.510 --> 42:09.690
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

42:00.360 --> 42:01.360
and keep you warm.

42:04.710 --> 42:06.510
Since we're on different paths,

42:06.630 --> 42:07.830
I won't work with you.

42:09.870 --> 42:17.050
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

42:17.070 --> 42:24.240
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

42:18.710 --> 42:19.510
What's wrong?

42:21.710 --> 42:22.480
Nothing.

42:23.440 --> 42:24.880
Just lost a little trinket.

42:24.270 --> 42:27.850
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

42:25.760 --> 42:26.840
Some things

42:27.320 --> 42:28.630
are always with you,

42:27.870 --> 42:31.490
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

42:29.510 --> 42:31.520
so you start to think they'll always be there.

42:31.520 --> 42:37.930
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

42:42.320 --> 42:43.000
Qingyuan.

42:44.510 --> 42:45.510
Whoever hurts you

42:45.670 --> 42:46.760
is my enemy.

42:47.230 --> 42:48.960
You want to avenge your mother.

42:49.550 --> 42:50.810
And I'll do it with you.

42:53.030 --> 42:54.030
Can you tell me

42:53.220 --> 42:59.690
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

42:54.920 --> 42:55.670
who it is?

42:59.800 --> 43:06.960
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

43:00.150 --> 43:00.920
Heir,

43:01.550 --> 43:03.080
if you truly want to help me,

43:03.960 --> 43:04.710
I'll tell you

43:05.230 --> 43:06.480
someday.

43:07.140 --> 43:14.500
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

43:08.510 --> 43:09.320
Alright.

43:13.710 --> 43:15.590
We're getting married soon.

43:14.610 --> 43:21.780
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

43:16.230 --> 43:17.800
Qingyuan, can you

43:18.360 --> 43:19.510
call me Chunzhi?

43:21.880 --> 43:29.180
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

43:22.030 --> 43:23.000
Chunzhi.

43:29.310 --> 43:36.120
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

43:30.230 --> 43:31.000
Don't worry.

43:31.840 --> 43:33.570
Since I've agreed to marry you,

43:33.760 --> 43:35.480
I'll be a good wife to you.

43:37.000 --> 43:37.630
Alright!

43:38.670 --> 43:39.200
Let's go.

43:39.510 --> 43:40.440
Let's go buy the Eastern Pearls.
